  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The sea area has a clear breeze and a calm sea that resembles a mirror, with blue skies, white clouds, and a clear horizon between sea and sky. Countless white cranes fly around or stand on small islands.",
      "chapters": [
        1483
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After later capture the same sea area is barren, robbed bare, with nothing left of that serene vitality.",
      "chapters": [
        1488
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai He is the owner of white crane sea area. She is one of the six beauties of Eastern Sea. At the center of the sea area she laughs as You Chan comes to seek her help. She keeps a rank six Immortal Gu House there, Bai He Palace, with countless women living in it as her harem.",
      "chapters": [
        1483
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_he",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_you_chan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_bai_he_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and three other immortals leave dragonfish sea area and arrive here. Shadow Sect Gu Immortals start capturing the cranes. Fang Yuan plunges to the deep sea for Bai He Palace, which Qin Bai He left behind to defend the sea area from accidents. After he takes the house apart, they capture all the white cranes: countless ordinary cranes, twenty one desolate beast cranes, and four ancient desolate beast cranes. They also take the sea’s resources: great history iron, a rank seven immortal material of metal path and wisdom path, and egg crystal rock, the life essence of eggmen after death. The amount of egg crystal rock shows that a huge group of eggmen once lived here.",
      "chapters": [
        1487
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "resource-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Yue Zhi Cheng flies above white crane sea area and finds it barren. In the past it had a serene environment with flying white cranes and was filled with vitality. After the capture it is robbed bare, with nothing left.",
      "chapters": [
        1488
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
